# --- Tauri / Rust ---
# Compiled artifacts and IDE-ish state; do NOT ignore Cargo.lock (binary crate
# — committing it pins exact dep versions for reproducible builds).
src-tauri/target/
src-tauri/gen/
src-tauri/WixTools/

# --- Local DB / quote cache ---
# The Tauri build writes portfolio.db to the OS app-data dir, but if anyone
# runs a one-off script that drops one alongside the source, keep it out.
portfolio.db
portfolio.db-journal
portfolio.db-shm
portfolio.db-wal
*.sqlite
*.sqlite-journal

